      <item>
        <title>team humanity</title>
        <dc:creator>@sama</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>team humanity</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>jason (@jxnlco)</b>
<p>
<p>one of the most beautiful things about OpenAI is that every employee really has a voice.<br>
<br>
i wanted to capture what it feels like to work here, what our mission means to me, and why you should join us. so i made this video with Codex, shared it with the team, and they felt it was worth producing and sharing with the world.<br>
<br>
this is our mission. and it’s why i’m here.</p>
