      <item>
        <title>it could be faster</title>
        <dc:creator>@sama</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>it could be faster</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Tibo (@thsottiaux)</b>
<p>
<p>The day we develop really good models. There will be signs.<br>
<br>
Reliability increasing despite load going up and up. Sudden efficiency gains. Things getting faster. Resets.<br>
<br>
These kinds of things.</p>

</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/thsottiaux/status/2083053369351090254#m">https://nitter.net/thsottiaux/status/2083053369351090254#m</a>
