      <item>
        <title>good job little bro</title>
        <dc:creator>@sama</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>good job little bro</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>OpenAI (@OpenAI)</b>
<p>
<p>After deployment, we applied GPT-5.6 Sol to advance the frontier of efficiency by making itself more efficient to run. <br>
<br>
The results:<br>
- 20% lower serving costs from production GPU kernel improvements.<br>
- 15%+ better token-generation efficiency from improved speculative decoding.</p>

</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/OpenAI/status/2082577277246972300#m">https://nitter.net/OpenAI/status/2082577277246972300#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
