        <description><![CDATA[<p>stories like this should be told more</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Polymarket (@Polymarket)</b>
<p>
<p>JUST IN: ChatGPT surfaces a crucial mutation in a woman’s old biopsy records, helping doctors determine her terminal glioblastoma diagnosis was incorrect.</p>

</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/Polymarket/status/2080759839513280770#m">https://nitter.net/Polymarket/status/2080759839513280770#m</a>
