      <item>
        <title>let us know what you think of pro-ultra-superhard</title>
        <dc:creator>@sama</dc:creator>
        <description><![CDATA[<p>let us know what you think of pro-ultra-superhard</p>
<hr/>
<blockquote>
<b>Ethan Mollick (@emollick)</b>
<p>
<p>Agreed: GPT-5.6 Pro (which is only available via the chatbot) is the smartest model out there. GPT-5.6 Ultra (the best model in Codex) is not near as powerful on hard tasks.<br>
<br>
For really hard problems: GPT-5.6 Sol Pro&gt;Fable 5 Ultracode &gt; GPT-5.6 Sol Ultra. (Yes, this is confusing)</p>

</p>
<footer>
— <cite><a href="https://nitter.net/emollick/status/2080515937803886872#m">https://nitter.net/emollick/status/2080515937803886872#m</a>
</footer>
</blockquote>]]></description>
